# display_gap_bogus_resend_without_list: A bogus state (7) after the mode list was consumed: the guest sets ackPending again and acks expectedAck, and the machine resends (12) from the page's own mode count, with no list to compare, bumping expectedAck. A state of 0xffffffff does the same. With a list pending the resend also rewrites the modes.
